81fc51b.webm?t=1741404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860400/extras/c0f29a1f5dc463ff27cfe5ca581fc51b.mp4?t=1741404108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860400/extras/7cd6a16730341b2fc4d6d6a7d9d0700a.avif?t=1741404108\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><br><strong>With a selection of maps to choose from, and more to come in the future, the lasers can never get boring! Calculate those angles and break your friends open like a cold one. With an array of powerups you can grab, the fun will never end, so long as you keep on shooting!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860400/extras/5e43c696a5c807351b2dc63cda827032.poster.avif?t=1741404108\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860400/extras/5e43c696a5c807351b2dc63cda827032.webm?t=1741404108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860400/extras/5e43c696a5c807351b2dc63cda827032.mp4?t=1741404108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860400/extras/323ba342c9f13096531475b921ff07f3.avif?t=1741404108\" width=620 height=70 /></span><br><br><strong>Our Discord is linked here in the store page, and you can also receive a link from in-game. Feel free to reach out to a developer!</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2860400?t=1741404108","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2860400/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741404108